tes that always work",[["New",["Studio now updates itself on every Yap++, old and new, straight from Yap++ Studio\u2019s own GitHub: one click on Update now and it reloads on the new version"]],["Fixed",["\u201cThis Yap++ is too old to update Studio\u201d: older Yap++ versions can update Studio now"]]]],["6.1","November 2026","Pixel Studio 2",[["New",["Pixel Studio 2: select a box, draw a lasso or use the magic wand, then copy, cut, paste, move, nudge, flip, rotate, crop or invert it. Drawing only happens inside the selection","New tools: dithered gradient, shade (lightens or darkens with a little hue shift), dither brush and pixel text","Pixel-perfect pencil lines, a round brush, and fill every pixel of a colour at once (Shift+click)","Hold Shift for straight and 45-degree lines, squares and circles. Alt+click takes a colour with any tool","Lock a layer\u2019s transparent pixels to paint only over what\u2019s already there","Canvas menu: resize with an anchor, scale 2x, flip, rotate, trim empty edges, crop, add an outline, swap colours","Trace over a picture, a big grid every 8, 16 or 32 pixels, and tile mode for patterns","A live animated preview, a shade ramp for your colour, grab colours from the picture, the colour under the cursor, and a shortcuts list (press ?)"]]]],["6.0","November 2026","Side Chat and a lot more",[["New",["Updates itself: Studio tells you when a new version is out and installs it in place with one click (no installer, settings stay). Updates are signed, so only real Studio updates can install","Android app: Yapin\u2019 with Studio built in, ping notifications even when the app is closed (tap one to jump to the message), quiet hours, and an off switch that really turns them off. Download it from the Yap++ Studio website","Sync code: copy all your settings as one code and paste it on your phone or another computer (Advanced)","On phones: drag the Studio button anywhere, swipe the quick panel down to close it, a little buzz on achievements, and the screen stays on during a focus session","Works on phones (in the browser, from the Yap++ Studio website): Studio fits Yapin\u2019s phone layout, a small Studio button opens the quick panel, and Side Chat fills the screen. Pixel Studio stays on computers and tablets","Side Chat: keep another server's chat open in a small window while you use a different one. Pin up to 6 chats as tabs, drag, resize, minimise to a bubble that counts new messages","A Side Chat button in every channel header, and Ctrl+Shift+D to open or close it","Productivity page: sticky notes (Ctrl+Shift+N), a focus timer with breaks, break reminders and text shortcuts like ;shrug;","Spotlight people: highlight messages from the people you care about","Yap++'s plugin page redesigned: cards with icons, hover glow, search and On / Off filters","Studio redesign: a glow that follows your mouse, a sliding menu highlight, glowing switches and shiny buttons","6 new achievements in a new Productivity group","Presets: Neon Night, Forest Moss, Ocean Deep","Badges: chat bubble, clock, notepad","Quick panel: Side Chat, note and timer buttons, and drawn icons instead of emoji","Pixel Studio: a full pixel art editor for banners, profile pictures, decals and server icons, with layers, shapes, fill, mirror drawing, undo, palettes, saved projects, image import and PNG export at upload size","A new clock: Boxed and Pixel styles, sizes, the date, and drag it anywhere","A redesigned focus timer with Boxed and Pixel styles and a count of your sessions today","The official Yap++ Studio icon, and a Yap++ \xd7 Yap++ Studio loading screen when Yap++ opens (turn it off in Advanced)","A new achievement pop-up, and achievements sorted by rarity","Redesigned Achievements page: your rank, stats, recently unlocked, a reward track, search and sorting","Redesigned Credits page with the full release history","Animation in Pixel Studio: frames with their own timing, onion skin, playback, animated GIF export (with a size check against Yapin's limits), sprite sheets, and opening animated GIFs as frames","My Decals: spot who's wearing the decorations you made as you browse"]]]],["5.0","November 2026","The fun update",[["New",["Fun page: a desk pet ghost you can click, message confetti, click ripples, cursor sparkle trail, typing sparkles","Typing and send sounds made on your PC, with a volume slider","Rainbow accent that cycles your accent colour everywhere","Photo filters: Vivid, Dreamy, Vintage, Sepia, B&W","Achievements page with 15 goals and pop-ups when you unlock one","Your stats on Home","Theme codes: copy your colours as a short code or paste a friend\u2019s","Presets: Galaxy, Matrix, Sunset Beach, Retro Terminal, Strawberry Milk","Badges: sword, pizza, mushroom, bunny, planet, sun","Layout: server icon size, member list width, image size limit, rounded message box","Privacy: blur avatars, hide your status text","Background effects: hearts, bubbles, leaves","Ctrl+Shift+P switches to the next theme preset","This Updates page"]],["Fixed",["Stars and Fireflies backgrounds now twinkle and drift"]]]],["4.0","November 2026","The big redesign",[["New",["New look with a grouped side menu, page headers, search and a master on/off switch","Credits page","Installer with a safety letter"]],["Fixed",["The profile bar no longer moves right and hides a button when frosted panels are on"]]]],["3.0","October 2026","Badges and more",[["New",["Badges page: wear pixel badges, shareable with other Studio users through your bio","Quick panel (Ctrl+Shift+Y)","More effects, presets and hide options"]]]],["2.0","October 2026","More of everything",[["New",["Theme schedules, gradient accents, fonts, density, avatar shapes and chat tools","Faster: one page watcher and only rebuilding styles when something changes"]]]],["1.0","October 2026","First release",[["New",["Themes, colours, layout and background settings for Yapin\u2019 inside Yap++"]]]]];const dt={common:{name:"Common",xp:10,c1:"#8f9bab",c2:"#dfe5ec"},ra